    <solution><p>To change a percentage to a decimal, we move the decimal point to the left twice.</p>
<p><m>\displaystyle{ 13\% = {0.13} }</m></p>
<p><m>\displaystyle{ 52\% = {0.52} }</m></p>
</solution>
